{"dog":{"age_group":"young","application_url":"https://www.nycacc.org/adopt/adoption-process/","availability_detail":"available","breed_display":"Medium mixed breed","breed_primary":"Medium Mixed Breed Cross","description_text":"Since I'm a long stay pup, my adoption fee has been reduced! Visit me today to find out my favorite treats and how you can take me home!\n\nMy foster writes: Advent toy enjoyer and snooze snorer, Panna Cotta is full of joy and whimsy! She makes funny faces from time to time too! Panna Cotta knows a bunch of tricks, super smart that's what she is! Panna Cotta could match your energy, she loves cuddles, play, and giving kisssss! She gets super happy when meeting people. Panna Cottas available for adoption! Come meet Panna Cotta! Find more of Panna Cotta via @fosteringfamilynyc\n\nMy foster writes: She's a silly girl who loves to go out on walks with you, she loves people watching, dog watching, you name it. She is a dog filled with love and excitement and she's ready to share it with a special someone. Panna Cotta would do well in a household without small animals.","detail_url":"https://nycaccpets.shelterbuddy.com/animal/animalDetails.asp?s=adoption&searchTypeId=4&animalType=3%2C16&pagesize=75&task=view&tpage=10&searchType=4&animalid=199782","id":"af543177d5a0e7e08837d62a6ebd0f36","image_urls":["https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/105ac11794294de1a426ddf151338b14-1774699985-1781602763-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/8f75383806b94c53ad62f097ae36e4a0-1776264695-1777578618-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/8c2dea24d75c4670a14c06fbf81b1128-1776264695-1776264695-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/727a2c6872c34cb981bf696ced870868-1776264694-1776264694-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/b31ef74efdf640efa8ea35563656eceb-1776264694-1776264694-jpg/600---n","https://nycacc.shelterbuddy.com/storage/image/8b0f3c93ef1847bf906e78009944e5f0-17746